  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Best Farmers Training I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is an essential preparatory training conducted before the incoming PTM23UG01 Best Farmers Mission. This training will prepare the 13 Best Farmers that won a national farming competition, of which a part of the price is a mission to the Netherlands to get acquainted with Dutch expertise on Agriculture and to create sustainable business leads. This training will teach the farmers practical skills to maximize the output of this mission. The farmers will learn Dutch business etiquette and how to pitch their business and will be schooled on important themes such as access to finance.</narrative>
  </description>
